1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,580
Sahabat karib ini, Umair bin Wahab

2
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:02,780
mencarinya.

3
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,130
Sahabat karib kepada Safwan ini cari

4
00:00:05,130 --> 00:00:06,600
dia, mana pergi Safwan.

5
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:07,800
Rupanya dia takut.

6
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,210
Takut kalau-kalau Nabi akan

7
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:12,200
menghukum dia.

8
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:17,210
Dan bertemu ketika dia menaiki kapal

9
00:00:17,210 --> 00:00:18,600
ke Jeddah.

10
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:21,310
Menaiki kapal di Jeddah untuk

11
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:22,800
melarikan diri ke Yaman.

12
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:24,120
Dia dah siap nak pergi ke

13
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:25,800
Yaman lah, nak naik kapal.

14
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:28,350
Dibawa menghadap Rasulullah SAW,

15
00:00:28,350 --> 00:00:30,800
janganlah kamu pergi ke Yaman.

16
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:33,350
Mari, mari jumpa Muhammad, jumpa

17
00:00:33,350 --> 00:00:34,800
Rasulullah SAW.

18
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,010
Apabila menghadap Rasulullah SAW,

19
00:00:37,010 --> 00:00:39,560
memberikan hadiah kepada dia, serban

20
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:41,400
yang dipakai baginda.

21
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,300
Nabi bagi serban.

22
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,930
Walaupun dia penjenayah,

23
00:00:48,290 --> 00:00:51,800
walaupun dia ini buat salah,

24
00:00:52,800 --> 00:00:55,600
Nabi buat baik dengan dia, bagi serban.

25
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:59,200
Ketika memasuki Makkah, Nabi bagi dia.

26
00:01:02,200 --> 00:01:02,680
Dia dapat faham ini petanda yang

27
00:01:02,680 --> 00:01:07,200
baiklah bahawa Nabi akan menerima dia.

28
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Memaafkan dia.

29
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:12,237
Lalu Safwan berkata, ij'alni bil

30
00:01:12,237 --> 00:01:14,173
khiyar syahraini.

31
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,200
Berikan aku masa 2 bulan.

32
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:22,310
Untuk aku berfikir, memilih sikap.

33
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:24,400
Maksudnya untuk aku tentukan sikap

34
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,900
aku, aku nak masuk Islam atau

35
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:27,000
tak masuk Islam.

36
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:30,960
Beri aku 2 bulan, kata Safwan.

37
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:36,400
Rasulullah SAW menjawab, anta bil

38
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:38,200
khiyar arba'ata asyhur.

39
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:41,600
Aku berikan kamu tempoh selama 4 bulan.

40
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:44,200
Tak usahlah 2 bulan.

41
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:47,900
Untuk kamu fikir nak masuk Islam.

42
00:01:49,800 --> 00:01:51,110
Bukan 2 bulan, 4 bulan aku

43
00:01:51,110 --> 00:01:52,000
beri kamu.
